{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4e6cf372ba57419bd8ad896b089184656be3a4953e35721e1c0a5a4d534302a3", "ja": "これからも一緒に", "zh": "今后也一起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "87c7c81f4de851be8ef5454e620d9ec90410e5868628ba9753ecac856c93e467", "ja": "出演した番組の視聴会を行うTeam3rd。\r\n互いに気付きあい寄り添いあい、これからも\r\n一緒に歩いていこうと語る5人。写真集にも\r\n重版がかかり、仕事は大成功を収めた。\r\n3rdが繋いだバトンは、次のチームへ！", "zh": "举办出演节目的观看会的Team3rd。\n彼此察觉对方的心意，互相陪伴，5人约定今后也要一起走下去。写真集还进行了再版，工作取得了巨大成功。\n由3rd传下的接力棒，将交给下一个团队！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "37a572a323de164367289b4ec7e5d8e2ba6fd8182c799439f6c1fda9817aeca2", "ja": "出演番組の録画視聴会……", "zh": "出演节目的录像观看会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "b6d7004d0a1de75fe76d9777418f80394de5d6d31e7b800d0bf6218ca74f18b8", "ja": "お仕事なのに、こんなに楽しくていいのかなって思う\nくらい。そんなこと、全然想定してなかったのに……", "zh": "甚至觉得，明明是在工作，\n这么开心真的好吗。我明明完全没有设想过这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "072d796647f8d47de3e13bdfe4afe952da2d9b0134fa81675851068dfe145e7b", "ja": "私は、仲間と一緒に……\n一緒の時間を過ごすことが、きっと……。", "zh": "我，和大家在一起……\n和同伴共度的时光，一定……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "723233930f15f26c200005c9fd1b293c4590a40f04031c906b6bf3098cedd134", "ja": "ここ！　ここエモかったよね！\nやっぱいいこと言うよね、琴葉は！", "zh": "这里！这里很让人感动吧！\n琴叶果然很会说话呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "365bc32b9f1cf4092dc887b2cdf5f5019a19346fe0927e9c05378aecc8373ae8", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。……でも、ここ見るの3回目だし、\nもういいんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。……不过，这里都看第3遍了，也该差不多了吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "d86a5a10d748f9ecc5482b6b81932b8a8f51ee6e981560fd28232823492da3cb", "ja": "よくないし！\nこんなの何回言われても嬉しいし！", "zh": "怎么会够呢！\n这种话不管听多少次都很开心的好吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "f3b944f0808da4222cd08213e4643886b22134a3ac071c0f65ee4a586a548512", "ja": "でも、やっぱり不謹慎だったかも。\nこれじゃ遊びに行ったみたいだよね？", "zh": "不过，果然还是有点不合时宜吧。\n这样看起来就像是去玩了一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "7df88ba671cbd5fb45b93bb6c48f19cda3b9101e1927eeffda293c0882016d63", "ja": "だーーっ、そんなことないってば！\nほら、百合子もなんか言ってやって！", "zh": "啊——！才不是那回事呢！\n你看，百合子也说点什么呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "179c45d247d3c6df4a5d5922c6233ceb5167cb38dfef6402ddbbe99360c8289e", "ja": "ええっ！？　は、はい、えっと……私、運動は苦手で、\n南の島では結構足を引っ張ってたと思うんです……。", "zh": "诶！？啊、是的，那个……我不擅长运动，在南方的小岛上应该拖了不少后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "c336e2a102361287c997859bbac20a0a16123ec6e383786dc23fbed157fa6232", "ja": "でも、一緒なことをこんなに喜んでもらえたんだって\n思うと……救われた気分で、泣きそうになります！", "zh": "可是，一想到大家竟然会为和我做同一件事感到如此开心……我就觉得自己得到了救赎，简直都要哭出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "3f3b5eb5caca59a65662e02024541c9c0bd25a2947c66ecd68047ea87df3ac4a", "ja": "百合子ちゃんは、ずっと一生懸命だから。\n苦手なことでもくじけないで……それが嬉しいんだよ？", "zh": "因为百合子一直都在努力。\n即使是自己不擅长的事情，也不会气馁……能这样坚持下去，我真的很开心哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "7fedc7fb2ab85e606725ed4ef9653ac628637540c50b1697b6fa4a46f4de5ff6", "ja": "はあっ、ダメです！\nホントに泣きそうになるので、ほめないでください！", "zh": "哈啊，不行了！\n我真的快要哭出来了，所以请别夸我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d888eb830b4efce0eb06677280bb34011e9eeec34623e93d30f4c0e8e72705ea", "ja": "ふふっ。きっとみんな、気持ちで繋がれたんだね。\nだから一緒にいても嬉しくて、楽しくて。", "zh": "呵呵。大家一定是心意相通了吧。\n所以即使待在一起，也会觉得开心、快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "356fe16c27def84ebbae51b576fc9cd7a735379bcb15af606de9c0ac1df0bb55", "ja": "私はね、たくさんの人の心に寄り添えたらと思って\nアイドルになったの。でも……。", "zh": "我啊，是因为希望能贴近许多人的心，才成为偶像的。但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "10730e7c1bb5512875d0cf7644e23f50c4b01ec64636d9c292d7c50b30e0ba0b", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんの言葉を聞いて、本当は寄り添い合いた\nかったんだろうな、って思っちゃった♪", "zh": "听了琴叶的话，我就不禁觉得，你其实是想和别人彼此依靠的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "fca5abbad6265404094ffa4bf4f65de0ee987fed325fab71ffbf1f1769c7e515", "ja": "風花さん……。私もです。困った時に\n寄り添ってもらえるから、とっても心強くて。", "zh": "风花小姐……我也是。因为遇到困难时能得到您的陪伴，所以让我觉得特别有依靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "ef3c124ab04c3ac787f79febdd9360c2468271874345b208f55f51421cb46f04", "ja": "たまきもすっごく楽しいぞ！\nことはと遊んだこと、思い出しちゃった！", "zh": "环也觉得特别开心！\n想起和琴叶一起玩的时候了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "1b75a15633ce4f8822623526e887834616070fdee1d7cc0f5369fdc0a7c7cf78", "ja": "ことははものしりだし、うきわ用意してくれたし、\nあぶない時にちゃんと止めてくれた！", "zh": "琴叶见多识广，还帮我准备了游泳圈，在危险的时候也及时阻止了我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "8d4e695a92c4c22dfcec5d146217d8343e493610006567d48c3f2e56d69bc736", "ja": "ことはと探検してて、楽しかった！　だからね……\nことはも楽しいって言ってくれて、うれしかったぞ～♪", "zh": "和琴叶一起探险，特别开心！所以呢……\n听到琴叶也说很开心，我也好高兴哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "f50cd0496e14f047e8b8c21c089f6434753d7ba3c7d345bab37e82815882023c", "ja": "うん。環ちゃんの探検のおかげで、私もいろんな\n経験ができたよ。……ありがとう、環ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯。多亏了小环的探险，我也获得了各种经历。\n……谢谢你，小环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "b12155979addacd71203cbf66f235af6fc6db2ae925381a1e004e7e7ae0ef8fa", "ja": "たまきも、ありがとう♪\nまた一緒に探検してね、ことは！", "zh": "环环也要谢谢你♪\n下次也要一起去探险哦，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "c1619ddc714dd537d9f27036fd8442d98721729bc9d2e6fe87a98a6ac85c0b65", "ja": "それから恵美も。\nたくさん、ありがとう。", "zh": "还有惠美。\n真的非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a074aa76d78194628467482384574fa694ee81554313a224333f63cd3119339", "ja": "え、アタシ？　なにが？", "zh": "诶，我？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "c1661bc19cb4e1b11258405879bb109c701f7ab8de48a08f2a40531b8fbcfc43", "ja": "えっとね……いろいろ。\nふふっ、これからもよろしくね。", "zh": "那个……各方面吧。\n呵呵，以后也请多多关照哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "8e7d5f832a2ba712ff50ab12caf29ef365086c06e42e9bad05faac9c47b54c5b", "ja": "んー？　なんかよくわかんないけど、まいっか！\nこちらこそよろしくね、リーダー♪", "zh": "嗯—？虽然不太懂，不过无所谓啦！\n我这边才要请你多关照呢，队长♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "0cc6f4a591d57901e12c68b76c76ffbf9ac4fa7f39f638ce82871f30e643c472", "ja": "リーダーっていっても、何もできてないけど……。\nただ私たちは、きっと気づきあえると思う。", "zh": "虽说是队长，但我其实什么都没做到……  \n不过，我想我们一定能彼此察觉到对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "48460508184f373d93296c047910b896dd4e5f7b1e52cc09d98da56c3657dd9d", "ja": "気づいて、見つけて、寄り添い合って……\nそんな風にして、これからも。", "zh": "彼此察觉、彼此发现、彼此陪伴……\n今后也要这样，一起走下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "ae73059bb4be58bf131a6aee6f2c334b9a5b4bfc43359ee846f442a600a187a7", "ja": "一緒に歩いて行きましょう！", "zh": "一起走下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "0d24f9a722cc8cfdf3c4b5a63887b254487459a9253412fed00e6a5c9d2e6443", "ja": "うん♪", "zh": "嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1032_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1033_403sor", "source_sha256": "61ff6fb955d6d38f9bc0c6ecb51098e610a6723cb3412045def5d66c8da2343c", "ja": "お疲れさまです、カメラマンの早坂でーす！\nみなさん、こちらにいるとうかがって……よいしょ。", "zh": "辛苦了，我是摄影师早坂——！\n听说大家在这里……嘿咻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
