{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1045_401pro", "source_sha256": "d66f3e9c1ea3bed31eb092cea927d7cb3f2916386d98d76c342256d3b38d7036", "ja": "そういうわけで、みんなにサインをしてもらう分、\n運んできたんだ。悪いけど、頼めるかな……？", "zh": "所以，我把要请大家签名的那部分运过来了。不好意思，能拜托你吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "33c68aebdee2ad53ace3d7fa52004b40c5dea8c1cf96f630af772cc3d2ee590d", "ja": "え、こんなにたくさん！？\nにゃはは、すごいね、なんかアイドルっぽい！", "zh": "诶，这么多！？\n呀哈哈，好厉害，总觉得很有偶像的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1047_401pro", "source_sha256": "47a874b21a0f72f450728be5e4ae6b55607c33c1a7e451eea572dac96ae242a9", "ja": "あははっ、アイドルだからな？", "zh": "啊哈哈，因为是偶像嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "e7ad810838ae99e7bf216961e7e9209b9981a780d76c532d9e57faa1674d427e", "ja": "うう、せっかくキレイな表紙なのに\n上から私の字を書くのは、正直まだ抵抗が……！", "zh": "呜呜，这么漂亮的封面，\n要在上面写我的字，说实话我还是有点抗拒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1049_040tam", "source_sha256": "fee27843904c33f7160f12e0b22536b6249e8291266544d85552a15990cda6fa", "ja": "たまき、サイン慣れたから平気だぞ～！\nおっきい字でいっぱい書くんだ～♪", "zh": "环，玉，你已经习惯签名了，所以没问题啦～！\n要用大大的字写满满的哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1050_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9ca6fc0542b1aeaf13968ea1e20557b19b352dc7e601a3c542efb9ef52737bbb", "ja": "この写真集で、またたくさんの人と\n出会えるなら……うん、頑張りますっ！", "zh": "如果能通过这本写真集，再和许许多多的人相遇……嗯，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "843f573123a58de99441287a0b674a363a1295b44cc9fe0d4404c71caf13035c", "ja": "この数だとインクが付かないよう、着替えてから書いた\nほうがいいかも。……みんな、行きましょう！", "zh": "这么多的话，为了不沾上墨水，还是换好衣服再写比较好。……大家，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1052_403sor", "source_sha256": "6a5803929f7ca8ef0ed3b971048c8383eac9a7b989475c4c64b82e69ab7822bc", "ja": "さて、ちょっと早いですけど……\n写真集関係のお仕事は、これで一段落ですね。", "zh": "那么，虽然现在说还有点早……  \n写真集相关的工作，到这里就暂告一段落了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1053_401pro", "source_sha256": "ef54695a61e7f2b85ef5273428e5fb263acb30500144f70d0b3de6771632a3eb", "ja": "はい。南の島から始まって、番組収録時の\nスチル撮影まで、本当にお世話になりました！", "zh": "是的。从南方小岛开始，一直到节目录制时的剧照拍摄，真的非常感谢您的关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1054_403sor", "source_sha256": "39a7c42521068ce4996764c9b852c3a160159e535d59af2089dc7f1da6fb7f27", "ja": "あはは、またすぐお会いすると思いますけどね。\nシアタープロジェクトは、まだまだこれからですから！", "zh": "哈哈，我想我们很快又会见面的。剧场企划还只是刚刚开始呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1055_401pro", "source_sha256": "84efba945c83bd4968aad5d23caee1f3c483b8e7b54f7a77a357de1328f619cc", "ja": "はい、またよろしくお願いします！\nさて……。", "zh": "好的，之后也请多多关照！那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_06_1056_401pro", "source_sha256": "2eec8b13b7ac302efe45319d8948cbff939ce1f2d39377b2e1477ef063f3f69c", "ja": "本当に、まだまだこれからなんだよな。\n今のうちに、次のチームに連絡しておくか……！", "zh": "真的，现在还只是刚刚开始呢。趁现在，先联系一下下一组吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
